{"2296380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I Expect You To Die 3: Cog in the Machine", "steam_appid": 2296380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just when you thought you were out, we’re pulling you back in, Agent!</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/129f34d6b1da3ff52e602bf87717846b.poster.avif?t=1785432070\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/129f34d6b1da3ff52e602bf87717846b.webm?t=1785432070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/129f34d6b1da3ff52e602bf87717846b.mp4?t=1785432070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Outwit your most cunning adversary to date in the latest installment of this beloved escape room, spy-fi puzzle series. Dr. Roxana Prism, scientist and former Agency inventor, believes she can create a better agent, one that’s superior to our human agents. Wield new gadgets, visit six action-packed locales, and wear custom disguises as you dive back into the world of espionage.<br><br>Protect the Agency and the world as we know it, without losing your wits…or your life! ☠️<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <i>I Expect You To Die 3: Cog in the Machine</i>, you will:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race to Beat Dr. Zor</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/06a4b055839ccd085b75d2602cd0f8a7.poster.avif?t=1785432070\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296380/extras/06a4b055839ccd085b75d2602cd0f8a7.webm?t=1785432070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source 